## 🚀 Quick Start

### Prerequisites

```bash
# Install AWS CLI
curl "https://awscli.amazonaws.com/awscli-exe-linux-x86_64.zip" -o "awscliv2.zip"
unzip awscliv2.zip
sudo ./aws/install

# Install AWS SAM
brew install aws-sam-cli  # macOS
# or for Linux: pip install aws-sam-cli

# Install dependencies
pip install boto3 sagemaker pandas numpy

# Configure AWS credentials
aws configure
```

### Deploy in 5 Minutes

```bash
# 1. Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/your-org/ai-mshauri.git
cd ai-mshauri

# 2. Export deployment files
python deployment_config.py export

# 3. Deploy to AWS
bash deploy.sh dev

# 4. Get API endpoint
aws cloudformation describe-stacks \
  --stack-name ai-mshauri-dev \
  --query 'Stacks[0].Outputs' \
  --output table
```

