## 📡 API Documentation

### Mentorship Endpoint

**POST** `/mentorship`

#### Request

```json
{
  "phone_number": "+254712345678",
  "sauti_output": "You have the right to fair wages under the Employment Act 2007. Your employer must pay on time without illegal deductions.",
  "category": "wage_rights",
  "county": "Kisumu",
  "language": "sw"
}
```

#### Response

```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "user_id": "uuid-123",
  "phone_number": "+254712345678",
  "mentorship": "Kwa kuwa wewe ni mfanyikazi, hakikisha unaweka mikataba kwa maandishi. Wasiliana na Kisumu Tailors Co-op (SMS 1234) kwa msaada wa kisheria.",
  "delivery": {
    "sms": true,
    "whatsapp": false
  },
  "timestamp": "2025-10-15T14:30:00Z"
}
```

#### Error Response

```json
{
  "status": "error",
  "error": "Invalid phone number format",
  "timestamp": "2025-10-15T14:30:00Z"
}
```

### Parameters

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
| `phone_number` | string | Yes | User phone (international format: +254...) |
| `sauti_output` | string | Yes | Output from Sauti agent (legal info) |
| `category` | string | Yes | Problem category (wage_rights, land_dispute, etc.) |
| `county` | string | Yes | User's county (Kisumu, Nairobi, etc.) |
| `language` | string | No | Language code (sw/en/sheng, default: sw) |

### Response Codes

| Code | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| 200 | Success - Mentorship generated and delivered |
| 400 | Bad request - Invalid parameters |
| 429 | Rate limited - Too many requests |
| 500 | Server error - Internal Lambda error |

