## 💰 Cost Estimation

### Monthly Cost Breakdown (1M API calls)

| Service | Usage | Cost |
|---------|-------|------|
| **AWS Lambda** | 1M invocations @ 3s avg | $32 |
| **Bedrock (Claude)** | 1M inputs (1K tokens), 1M outputs (300 tokens) | $150 |
| **DynamoDB** | 2M read, 1M write units | $45 |
| **S3** | 1GB stored, 10GB transfer | $25 |
| **CloudWatch** | Logs, metrics, alarms | $20 |
| **SageMaker** | Monthly training job (2 hours) | $40 |
| **Africa's Talking SMS** | 1M messages @ $0.02 | $20,000 |
| **Total** | | **~$20,312/month** |

### Cost Optimization Tips

1. **Use Lambda Reserved Concurrency** - Save 30% on compute
2. **Enable DynamoDB On-Demand** - Pay only for what you use
3. **Batch Bedrock Calls** - Process messages in batches
4. **Compress S3 Data** - Reduce storage costs
5. **Use Spot Instances for Training** - Save 70% on SageMaker

